  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation 11 * 4 * 3 * 3 * 7 * 8\n\n**Option 1 :** Using the combination +, −, ×, ÷, =\n\n11 + 4 - 3 × 3 ÷ 7 = 8\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n11 + 4 - 3 × 0.42 = 8\n\n11 + 4 – 1.26 = 8\n\n15 – 1.26 = 8\n\n13.74 = 8** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : Using combination **×, ÷, +, −, =\n\n11 × 4 ÷ 3 + 3 - 7 = 8\n\n11 × 1.34 + 3 - 7 = 8\n\n14.74 + 3 - 7 = 8\n\n17.74 - 7 = 8\n\n10.74 = 8** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** Using the combination +, ×, ÷, −, =\n\n**11 + 4 ****× 3 ÷ 3 - 7 = 8**\n\n**11 + 4 ****× 1 - 7 = 8**\n\n**11 + 4 - 7 = 8 **\n\n**15 - 7 = 8**\n\n**8 = 8**** (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4 :** Using the combination ×, −, +, ÷, =\n\n11 × 4 - 3 + 3 ÷ 7 = 8\n\n11 × 4 - 3 + 0.42 = 8\n\n44 - 3 + 0.42 = 8\n\n44.42 - 3 = 8\n\n41.42 = 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the answer is **“+, ×, ÷, −, =”****.**",
